      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/pimento-dip-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once your cream cheese is softened to a point where you are able to stir it like a thick liquid, mix in your cheddar cheese.",
