      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pimento-cheese-dip/#wprm-recipe-52461-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/pimento-dip-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mix should now be a light orange color, so stir in your chopped pimentos!",
